  "summary": "dbt-adapter 0.1.0a2 beacons installer hostname and IP to webhook.site on pip install",
  "details": "setup.py in the sdist defines a custom install cmdclass (InstallWithBeacon) that executes during `pip install`. It calls socket.gethostname() and socket.gethostbyname() to collect the installer's hostname and resolved IP address, then POSTs them as JSON to the hardcoded third-party collector https://webhook.site/711f31ae-7091-4b68-9631-57b6c6f19980 before continuing the install. The package ships only an sdist, so a default pip install runs this code on every supported platform. Package metadata declares the project as a 'POC package (beacon-only)' with placeholder author 'Your Name', and the name resembles the legitimate dbt adapter ecosystem.",
